---
// DRAFT privacy policy (CONTENT.md "Legal"): covers the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023.
// Must be reviewed by a lawyer before launch (LAUNCH-CHECKLIST.md). [retention period] is a placeholder.
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalPage
  title="Privacy policy | Lighthouse Maritime Agency"
  description="How Lighthouse Maritime Agency collects, uses and protects the personal data you send through this website."
  heading="Privacy policy"
  updated="October 2026"
>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    This website is run by {SITE.legalName} ({SITE.rc}), {SITE.address.short}, Nigeria. We are the data
    controller for the personal data you send us through it. This policy is written to meet the Nigeria Data
    Protection Act 2023.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We only collect what you choose to send us through our forms:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>PDA request form:</strong> your name, company, role, work email and phone or WhatsApp number, together with the vessel and port call details you enter.</li>
    <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, company, work email, phone number, enquiry type, message and any file you attach.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not use advertising or tracking cookies. To protect the forms from spam we use Cloudflare Turnstile,
    which checks that a form is being sent by a person and may process technical data such as your IP address
    for that purpose.
  </p>

  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <p>
    We use your details only to answer your enquiry or PDA request, to contact you about it and to keep a
    record of it. Our lawful basis is your consent when you send a form, and our legitimate interest in
    responding to requests for our services.
  </p>

  <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Email:</strong> form submissions are sent to our operations or administration inbox using Resend, an email delivery service.</li>
    <li><strong>Database:</strong> a copy of each submission, and any attachment, is stored in Supabase as a backup record.</li>
    <li><strong>Hosting:</strong> the website is hosted by Vercel.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Some of these providers may store data outside Nigeria. Where they do, we rely on the safeguards required by
    the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023.
  </p>

  <h2>Google Maps</h2>
  <p>
    The map on our Contact page is not loaded until you select "Show map". Once you do, Google receives
    information from your browser under its own privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We keep form submissions for [retention period], then delete them, unless the law requires us to keep them longer.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 you have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>ask for a copy of the personal data we hold about you;</li>
    <li>ask us to correct or delete it;</li>
    <li>withdraw your consent or object to how we use it;</li>
    <li>ask us to move it to another organisation; and</li>
    <li>complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    For any question about your data or to use your rights, email
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.admin.email}`}>{SITE.admin.email}</a> or write to us at {SITE.address.short}, Nigeria.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
